WEBVTT

00:39:27.788 --> 00:39:30.788
and I think it applies to our
corporate structure at open.

00:39:30.829 --> 00:39:34.829
I you know, we sort of observe that if
you have very well-meaning people,

00:39:35.121 --> 00:39:38.496
but they have this incentive to sort
of maximize attention harvesting

00:39:38.496 --> 00:39:42.454
and profit forever through
no one's ill intentions,

00:39:42.454 --> 00:39:45.329
that leads to a quite undesirable outcome.

00:39:46.163 --> 00:39:50.496
And so we set up opening is this thing
called a capped profit model specifically

00:39:50.496 --> 00:39:54.996
so that we don't have the system incentive
to just generate maximum value

00:39:54.996 --> 00:39:57.996
forever with an AGI that seems
like obviously quite broken.

00:39:58.413 --> 00:39:59.788
But even though we knew that was bad

00:39:59.788 --> 00:40:02.079
and even though we all like to think
of ourselves as good people,